  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAGHAA is an international conference committed to addressing one of the most challenging issues facing the global community &#x2013;The Science and Geopolitics of Arctic-Antarctic-Himalayas. It focusses exclusively towards the holistic Arctic-Antarctic-Himalayan issue.</narrative>
